  "answer_text": "Here's an overview of **ProFed Credit Union** (accessible at [profedcu.org](https://www.profedcu.org)):\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe6 About ProFed Credit Union\n\nFounded in 1933, ProFed Credit Union is a **$740 million financial cooperative** with nearly **66,000 member-owners**. It provides financial services to members and businesses all over **Northeast Indiana**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83e\udd1d Membership\n\nYou can own a piece of the credit union with just **$5**. Membership gets you exclusive access to **lower fees and competitive rates**, plus local, personalized service, discounted perks, and a cooperative that supports your community.\n\nYou are eligible to join if you **live, work, worship, attend school, volunteer, or regularly conduct business** in Adams, Allen, DeKalb, Huntington, LaGrange, Noble, Steuben, Wells, and Whitley counties.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf10 Services & Resources\n\nProFed offers a wide range of resources for **kids, adults, and businesses** to help members become empowered on their financial journey \u2014 from budgeting basics to investing and planning for retirement.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udccd Branch Locations\n\nProFed has **13 branch locations** in northeast Indiana. Branches are located in communities including **Fort Wayne, Auburn, Decatur, New Haven, Bluffton**, and more.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcbc Community Involvement\n\nProFed takes pride in its work and involvement in the communities it serves, genuinely caring about its employees and sincerely wanting to make a difference for its members.\n\n---\n\nFor more information, you can visit their official website at **[profedcu.org](https://www.profedcu.org)** or connect with them via their social media pages. Would you like to know anything specific about ProFed Credit Union?",
